    "group": "Wrath of the Doomed",
    "summary": "For your **DEATH COMPANY** units:\n\n- The **[assault doctrine](vsdata:ability/space-marines.combat-doctrines)** becomes active at the start of every phase.\n- The **devastator/tactical doctrine** can never be active.\n\nWhatever other rules say, a **DEATH COMPANY** unit never has any active doctrine except the **assault doctrine**.\n\n**Restrictions:** **BLOOD ANGELS** units are allowed in your army, but **ADEPTUS ASTARTES** units from any other Chapter are not.",
